# Third-party models whose redistribution rights are unverified or incompatible with a public repository.
# They stay on the owner's machine only; the project runs without them (see Docs/ThirdParty.md).
/Assets/ThirdParty/Sketchfab/Vehicles/ferrari-f40-liberty-walk.zip*
/Assets/ThirdParty/Sketchfab/Vehicles/2026-ferrari-296-speciale-a.zip*
/Assets/_NeonRift/Levels/HarborRain/Imported/Vehicles/
/Assets/_NeonRift/Levels/HarborRain/Imported/Vehicles.meta
/Assets/_NeonRift/Levels/HarborRain/Generated/Vehicles/PF_HR_Ferrari*
/Assets/_NeonRift/Levels/HarborRain/Imported/Ships/DivingBoat/
/Assets/_NeonRift/Levels/HarborRain/Imported/Ships/DivingBoat.meta
# Ship source archives: only the cruise ship is used in place; the container and Liberty ships are used from
# their extracted copies under Levels/HarborRain/Imported/Ships; the rest are unused or of unknown origin.
/Assets/ThirdParty/Sketchfab/Ships/*
!/Assets/ThirdParty/Sketchfab/Ships/cruise_ship.glb
!/Assets/ThirdParty/Sketchfab/Ships/cruise_ship.glb.meta
!/Assets/ThirdParty/Sketchfab/Ships/ATTRIBUTION.txt
!/Assets/ThirdParty/Sketchfab/Ships/ATTRIBUTION.txt.meta
# Local tooling scratch
/.utmp/
# Spoken lines are generated locally with macOS System Voices. Apple's macOS licence allows those voices only for
# personal, non-commercial use and not for publishing or redistribution, so the recordings stay local; a public
# checkout plays the same lines as subtitle-only text (Docs/ThirdParty.md).
/Assets/_NeonRift/Levels/HarborRain/Generated/Audio/HR_VO_*
/Assets/_NeonRift/Levels/Campaign/Generated/Audio/Campaign_VO_*
